[2025.12.14-18.52.55:259][975]LogFabLauncher: Debug payload: [{"id":"0cf4c676-e56f-4762-8c5d-60360543f66d","path":"E:/Unreal projects/Objects/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Fall_Grijze_Populier_Tree_2K-0cf4c676/glb/converted","meshes":[{"file":"E:/Unreal projects/Objects/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Fall_Grijze_Populier_Tree_2K-0cf4c676/glb/converted/fall_grijze_populier_tree_2k.glb","name":"","material_index":0,"lods":[]}],"materials":[],"native_files":[],"additional_textures":[],"metadata":{"launcher":{"version":"0.0.1","listening_port":24563},"fab":{"assetNamespace":"","listing":{"averageRating":5,"createdAt":"","description":"<p>These versatile tree is perfect for adding a touch of realism and life to any environment, from forests and parks to backyards and streetscapes. Whether you’re a game developer, animator, or simply looking to enhance your renders, this poplars is sure to impress.</p>\n<p>Check out this animation I made using Unreal Engine:\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/aD4_ziyDpt4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">https://youtu.be/aD4_ziyDpt4</a></p>\n<p>Technical Specifications:</p>\n<p>*Dimensions: real world scale can be scaled.\nHeight:  900 - 1300 cm\nWide: 600 cm</p>\n<p><em>Low-poly design: With a focus on efficiency, these trees are optimized for smooth performance even on less powerful machines.\n</em>Multiple variations: With 9 unique models to choose from, you can create a variety of natural looks for your scenes.\n<em>Realistic textures: Each tree features detailed bark, leaves, and branches that capture the true essence of the Grijze populier.\n</em>Optimized for efficient rendering in various 3D engines.\n*UV-unwrapped for easy texture application.</p>\n<p>*Perfect for:\n-Game environments\n-Architectural visualizations\n-Art projects\n-And more!</p>","isAiForbidden":false,"isAiGenerated":false,"lastUpdatedAt":"2025-05-13T16:08:59.622002Z","listingType":"3d-model","media":"https://media.fab.com/image_previews/gallery_images/fb6ffbea-08